<Layout title="Privacy Policy · Monks Of Market" description="What this static calculator processes, what it does not store, and which network requests may occur.">
<section class="trust-page" id="privacy">
    <div class="shell">
      <a class="back-link" href="/">← Back to home</a>
      <header class="trust-header"><div><div class="eyebrow">Your data</div><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p class="trust-lead">What this site processes, what it does not store, and which network requests may occur.</p></div><div class="trust-date">Effective 6 October 2026<br>Last updated 6 October 2026</div></header>
      <div class="trust-layout">
        <nav class="trust-nav" aria-label="Trust pages"><a href="/about/">About</a><a href="/contact/">Contact</a><a href="/privacy/" aria-current="page">Privacy</a><a href="/terms/">Terms</a><a href="/disclaimer/">Disclaimer</a></nav>
        <div class="trust-copy">
          <section><h2>Overview</h2><p>Monks Of Market is currently a static, browser-based calculator. It does not provide user accounts, accept payments, or operate a server-side database for the calculator.</p></section>
          <section><h2>Calculator inputs</h2><p>Values entered into the calculators are processed in your browser to produce the displayed result. The page does not send those entries to Monks Of Market, and it does not save them to local storage, cookies or a user profile. Refreshing or leaving the page resets the session to the published defaults.</p></section>
          <section><h2>Network and technical data</h2><p>The page requests font files from Google Fonts. As with ordinary web requests, the font provider and the service hosting this page may receive technical information such as IP address, browser or device type, request time and referring information under their own policies and infrastructure practices.</p></section>
          <section><h2>Analytics</h2><p>Monks Of Market uses Google Analytics to understand aggregate usage of the site, such as which pages are visited and how visitors interact with the tools. Google Analytics sets cookies on your device and may collect information such as pages viewed, time spent, browser type, device type and approximate location. This data is aggregated and is not linked to your calculator inputs. You can opt out of Google Analytics without affecting your use of the site by installing the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.</p></section>
          <section><h2>Advertising</h2><p>Monks Of Market may display advertising served by Google AdSense. Google, as a third-party vendor, uses cookies — including the DoubleClick DART cookie — to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads based on your visit to this site and other sites on the internet. You may opt out of personalised advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>, and you can opt out of a third-party vendor's use of cookies for personalised advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="noopener">aboutads.info/choices</a>.</p></section>
          <section><h2>Cookies and browser storage</h2><p>Monks Of Market uses browser storage only for functional preferences: your chosen colour theme (dark or light) is saved in localStorage so the site remembers it on your next visit. On your first visit you are asked whether analytics and advertising cookies may be used; your choice is saved in localStorage and applied through Google Consent Mode, and you can change it at any time via the "Cookie settings" link in the footer. Calculator inputs are processed in your browser to produce the displayed result; the page does not send those entries to Monks Of Market and does not save them to a user profile. Third-party services described above (Google Analytics, Google advertising) may set their own cookies as described in their respective sections. A hosting platform or external font provider may apply its own technical controls outside Monks Of Market's page code.</p></section>
          <section><h2>Sharing and sale of data</h2><p>Monks Of Market does not collect calculator inputs, so it does not sell or share those inputs. No personal-data marketplace or targeted advertising profile is created by this page.</p></section>
          <section><h2>Children's privacy</h2><p>This site is about leveraged derivatives and is not directed to children. It does not knowingly collect personal information from children through the calculator.</p></section>
          <section><h2>Changes to this policy</h2><p>If analytics, advertising, accounts, subscriptions or contact forms are added later, this policy should be updated before those features are used. The effective date above identifies the version presented with this release.</p></section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
